# Wave-5 R-044: an enemy Gap Generator (GapGenerator=yes GapRadiusInCells=10)
# shrouds a circle of radius 10 for the player -- even under the player's
# own Spy Satellite (the gap raised the cells' ShroudCounter) -- except
# where the player's own units look [RE: abilities-w5.md §4].
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click combo:ai1
click "pick:Easy Enemy"
click start
until 120 scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
# The player's Spy Satellite reveals the whole map (GASPYSAT SpySat=yes).
cheat place GAPOWR 0 building 0:GACNST -5 -4
cheat place GASPYSAT 0 building 0:GACNST -5 +0
wait 5
assert gap_hidden == 0 @R-044:C
# An enemy gap generator with its own power, 16 cells away.
cheat place GAPOWR 1 building 0:GACNST +16 -4
cheat place GAGAP 1 building 0:GACNST +16 +0
wait 3
assert gap_hidden >= 250 @R-044:C
view building 1:GAGAP
wait 1
shot gap_shrouded
end
